        "body": "On Nacre Island, the tide takes every weapon except Ilyra’s prosthesis, which it recognises as part of Asteriel. Vesh makes the group hear a shared memory: the Heart is not a machine but a creature torn from the sea to feed the Lighthouse. Sena nearly confuses inherited grief with their own and Cael breaks ritual to support them. Vesh confirms Nara remains conscious inside the creature and demands Ilyra choose between returning it to the sea or negotiating a new relationship.\n\n## Notas\n\nGOAL: understand Aurel’s coordinate. OPPOSITION: Vesh gives no answer without experience and listening threatens Sena’s identity. TURN: Ilyra’s prosthesis contains glass from the Heart itself. CONSEQUENCE: rescuing Nara and freeing Asteriel become one conflict. RELATIONSHIP: Cael chooses crew over protocol.",
